  "notes": "Official 2025-2026 Early Childhood Education (AS-T) Online transfer pathway to CSUB, Cal-GETC pattern. IMPORTANT: the pathway's printed totals for semesters 3-4 are swapped relative to the rows — printed 'Total 15 / Total 16' but row sums give 16 / 15 (16+13+16+15=60; this holds in both the ONL and the to-CSUB-AV variant documents, confirming a genuine document error). Row sums are kept VERBATIM and total_credits = sequenced sum (60). An alternate variant of this pathway exists (2025-2026-CHDV-ECE-ONL-Pathway-to-CSUB-AV.pdf, to CSUB Antelope Valley) with the same semester 1-4 content. Only semesters 1-4 (the Cerro Coso degree portion) are sequenced; semesters 5-8 are CSUB upper-division coursework and are excluded. Credit ranges use the source's lower bound (documented). No course-level prerequisites are printed on the pathway.",
